        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1081] If the EVCC wants to receive the MeterInfo element, the EVCC shall set the parameter MeterInfoRequested to TRUE in the ChargeLoopReq, depending on the charging services on V2GTP payload type EXI encoded V2G messages.",
