        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1083] If the SECC wants to trigger a MeteringConfirmationReq/Res, the SECC shall include the MeterInfo in its ChargeLoopRes and set the EVSENotification to MeteringConfirmation.",
            "block_bbox": [
                71,
