            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2105] If EVSENotification is set to MeteringConfirmation in the ChargeLoopRes, the SECC shall provide a NotificationMaxDelay value. The SECC shall not send another message with EVSENotification set to MeteringConfirmation until it either received a MeteringConfirmationReq or the timeout, which was announced in the NotificationMaxDelay, has been reached.",
            "block_bbox": [
